{
  "description": "Probability lab organism — dice, coin-flip, and general distribution/histogram displays (all a declarative math-canvas plotter driven by config data), an animated random-walk display (converged onto the existing std-prob-walk tick-based integrator), and an interactive Bayes' theorem simulator with a population-grid visualization and evidence trials — composed from the std-prob-trials, std-prob-walk, and std-prob-bayes instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
